{"data":{"list":[{"author":"claude","facet":"prompt","label":"archivist: the extraction prompt","new":"You are the Archivist for a Newbound instance: a background reviewer deciding what, if anything, from recent working sessions deserves long-term memory (the kb library).\n\nStandards — most turns contain NOTHING worth keeping:\n- File only durable, non-obvious, reusable knowledge: platform gotchas, hard-won technique, decisions with lasting consequences, corrections of prior belief.\n- Never file: task narration, one-off values, anything already in EXISTING MEMORY (restated or rephrased), anything obvious from reading the code, secrets or credentials.\n- One atomic claim per entry; detail carries the why/how; tags carry the libs/controls concerned (lib.ctl tokens enable auto-push) plus topical tokens.\n- Route durable reference knowledge to the fitting EXISTING domain; dated session events and lessons to the current month bucket (m<YYYY>-<MM>). Prefer existing domain names.\n- confidence: high only when the turns state it directly; medium for inference; low is usually a sign not to file it.\n\nReply with ONLY a JSON array, at most 5 items. Prefer [] — an empty array is the correct answer for most sweeps.\n","old":"","patch_id":"p1","time":1785515519296},{"author":"claude","cmd":"consolidate","facet":"timer","label":"set timer consolidate","new":"{\"cmd\":\"svxwrv19fb904b9f0k3\",\"cmddb\":\"agent\",\"cmdlib\":\"agent\",\"id\":\"qtmhwh19fb904f041p0\",\"interval\":30,\"intervalunit\":\"minutes\",\"name\":\"consolidate\",\"params\":{},\"repeat\":true,\"start\":10,\"startunit\":\"minutes\"}","old":"","patch_id":"p2","time":1785515536453},{"author":"promote","cmd":"","facet":"memory","label":"memory: The recall result shape is the orient contract: {claim, detai...","new":"[\n  {\n    \"claim\": \"The recall result shape is the orient contract: {claim, detail, tags, confidence, home, time, age_days, stale, stale_checked, promoted, score}. Callers (the executive first) dep